# Environment variables for the Personal Internship Finder.
#
# Each app keeps its own example file:
#   frontend/.env.example  (VITE_* vars are PUBLIC: compiled into the browser bundle)
#   backend/.env.example   (server-only)
#
# Copy the relevant file to .env (backend) or .env.local (frontend) and fill in real values locally.
# Never commit real secrets. Never expose server-only keys to the browser.
